    predicate: http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related
    rationale: The evidence process is associated with the stated standard for claims and applications; no
      numerical confidence threshold is created.
    evidence:
    - page: page/dmg-vol1-ch1/0047
      quote: "01343 The DM must decide claims and applications on the balance of probability. This is not the same
        as\n\"beyond reasonable doubt\", the standard test for proof in criminal trials."
      locator: DMG 01343
